    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monkey love banana. Banana make monkey brain feel good. That\u2019s science.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bananaganza is a minimalist, casual arcade game where the only thing that matters is <i>bananas</i>. Forget the corporate grind for a while and focus on something that truly matters: collecting delicious banana slices, watching your score skyrocket, and flexing your reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWhy collect bananas?\u201d you might ask. Well, bananas are rich in Vitamin B6 and Vitamin C, which (spoiler alert) are <i>great</i> for you. So really, this isn\u2019t a game \u2014 it\u2019s a life improvement tool!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for the banana beatdown?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/357443708f9389fee645a76206cc6667.poster.avif?t=1752369740\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/357443708f9389fee645a76206cc6667.webm?t=1752369740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/357443708f9389fee645a76206cc6667.mp4?t=1752369740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peel. Slice. Collect. Repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Bananaganza, your ultimate mission is simple: collect as many banana slices as possible. But beware \u2014 not all bananas are created equal, and the rotten ones could ruin your fruity fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here\u2019s what you\u2019ll be doing in Bananaganza:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf4c Peel bananas like a pro.<br>\ud83c\udf4c Slice them into perfect pieces.<br>\ud83c\udf4c Catch the flying banana slices before they escape.<br>\ud83c\udf4c Dodge the rotten bananas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who knew fruit could be this intense?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/48efaa79aef23ed4de5101f980408482.poster.avif?t=1752369740\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/48efaa79aef23ed4de5101f980408482.webm?t=1752369740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/48efaa79aef23ed4de5101f980408482.mp4?t=1752369740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bananaganza is lovingly crafted by a solo indie developer whose top life goals are creating fun games. Every banana in this game was made with the hope of brightening your day.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monkey love banana. Banana make monkey brain feel good. That\u2019s science.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bananaganza is a minimalist, casual arcade game where the only thing that matters is <i>bananas</i>. Forget the corporate grind for a while and focus on something that truly matters: collecting delicious banana slices, watching your score skyrocket, and flexing your reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWhy collect bananas?\u201d you might ask. Well, bananas are rich in Vitamin B6 and Vitamin C, which (spoiler alert) are <i>great</i> for you. So really, this isn\u2019t a game \u2014 it\u2019s a life improvement tool!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for the banana beatdown?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/357443708f9389fee645a76206cc6667.poster.avif?t=1752369740\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/357443708f9389fee645a76206cc6667.webm?t=1752369740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/357443708f9389fee645a76206cc6667.mp4?t=1752369740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peel. Slice. Collect. Repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Bananaganza, your ultimate mission is simple: collect as many banana slices as possible. But beware \u2014 not all bananas are created equal, and the rotten ones could ruin your fruity fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here\u2019s what you\u2019ll be doing in Bananaganza:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf4c Peel bananas like a pro.<br>\ud83c\udf4c Slice them into perfect pieces.<br>\ud83c\udf4c Catch the flying banana slices before they escape.<br>\ud83c\udf4c Dodge the rotten bananas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who knew fruit could be this intense?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/48efaa79aef23ed4de5101f980408482.poster.avif?t=1752369740\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/48efaa79aef23ed4de5101f980408482.webm?t=1752369740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/48efaa79aef23ed4de5101f980408482.mp4?t=1752369740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bananaganza is lovingly crafted by a solo indie developer whose top life goals are creating fun games. Every banana in this game was made with the hope of brightening your day.</p>",
